=20

Re: Zahmoul v Secretary of State for Justice & Ors

N463 =E2=80=94 Urgent Application for Permission

Filed: 25 November 2025

=20

Please take this email as formal service of the Claimant=E2=80=99s N463 urgent ap=
plication filed in the Administrative Court on 25 November 2025.

=20

The complete N463 bundle was filed with the Court on that date.

For the avoidance of doubt, the Claimant is not re-sending the bundle, as i=
t exceeds standard email size limits and has already been provided in full t=
o the Administrative Court.

=20

Should the Defendants require access to any part of the bundle, they may re=
quest it from me directly or seek access via the Administrative Court Office=
.

=20

Yours faithfully,

Nadia Zahmoul

Email: nadia@rosekross.com

